    - Term: S_LevelTips_Des_level_06
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u5BC6\u7801\u662F\u2026\u2026"
      - The password is . . .
      - "A senha \xE9... qual ser\xE1?"
      - Kata sandinya adalah... apaan ya?
      - Ang password ay... ano kaya?
      - "\u30D1\u30B9\u30EF\u30FC\u30C9\u306F...\u306A\u306B\u304B\u306A\uFF1F"
      - "\u5BC6\u78BC\u662F\u2026\u2026\u5230\u5E95\u662F\u4EC0\u9EBC\u5462\uFF1F"
      - "\uBE44\uBC00\uBC88\uD638\uB294... \uBB58\uAE4C?"
      - "\u041F\u0430\u0440\u043E\u043B\u044C..."
      - "La contrase\xF1a es..."
      - "La contrase\xF1a es..."
      - "\u015Eifre..."
