    - Term: S_LevelTips_Des_level_55
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u5F53\u4F60\u4EC0\u4E48\u90FD\u770B\u4E0D\u5230\u7684\u65F6\u5019\uFF0C\u4F60\u5C31\u80FD\u770B\u5230\u771F\u76F8"
      - When you can't see anything, you can see the truth.
      - "Quando voc\xEA n\xE3o consegue ver nada, consegue ver a verdade."
      - Ketika kamu tidak bisa melihat apa pun, kamu bisa melihat kebenaran.
      - Kapag hindi mo makita ang lahat, doon mo makikita ang katotohanan.
      - "\u4F55\u3082\u898B\u3048\u306A\u304F\u306A\u3063\u305F\u6642\u3001\u771F\u5B9F\u304C\u898B\u3048\u308B\u3002"
