    - Term: S_LevelTips_Des_level_97
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u95E8\u53C8\u53C8\u53C8\u53C8\u98DE\u8D77\u6765\u4E86\uFF01"
      - The Door Flew Up Again, Again, Again, Again!
      - A porta voou de novo, de novo, de novo, de novo!
      - Pintunya terbang lagi, lagi, lagi, lagi!
      - Lumipad na naman ang pinto, ulit-ulit!
      - "\u30C9\u30A2\u304C\u307E\u305F\u307E\u305F\u307E\u305F\u307E\u305F\u98DB\u3093\u3067\u3044\u3063\u305F\uFF01"
