    - Term: S_LevelTips_Des_level_115
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u62D6\u52A8\u4EA4\u6362\u6570\u5B57\u6216\u7B26\u53F7\u4F7F\u7B49\u5F0F\u6210\u7ACB"
      - Swap digits/symbols to solve the equation.
      - "Troque os d\xEDgitos/s\xEDmbolos para resolver a equa\xE7\xE3o."
      - Tukar angka/simbol untuk menyelesaikan persamaan.
      - Pagpalitin ang mga digit/simbolo para lutasin ang equation.
