      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u597D\u6324\uFF01\u4E0D\u8981\u518D\u4E0A\u6765\u4E86\uFF01"
      - It's packed! No more people!
      - "Est\xE1 lotado! N\xE3o entre mais ningu\xE9m!"
      - Penuh sesak! Jangan naik lagi!
      - Siksikan na! Huwag nang sumakay!
      - "\u304E\u3085\u3046\u304E\u3085\u3046\u3060\u3088\uFF01\u3082\u3046\u4E57\u3089\u306A\u3044\u3067\uFF01"
