    - Term: S_answer_Des_level_21
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u5728\u6682\u505C\u83DC\u5355\u4E2D\u5173\u95ED\u58F0\u97F3\u548C\u97F3\u6548\u3002"
      - Turn off the sound and sound effects in the pause menu .
      - Desative o som e os efeitos sonoros no menu de pausa.
      - Matikan suara dan efek suara di menu jeda.
      - I-off ang tunog at sound effects sa pause menu.
      - "\u30DD\u30FC\u30BA\u30E1\u30CB\u30E5\u30FC\u3067\u97F3\u3068\u52B9\u679C\u97F3\u3092\u30AA\u30D5\u306B\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3002"
