    - Term: S_answer_Des_level_31
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u65E0\u9650\u8DF3\u5411\u5929\u7A7A\u4EE5\u51FB\u5012\u5BCC\u6709\u7684\u4EBA\u3002"
      - "Jump infinitely into the sky to knock down the \nrich person ."
      - "Pula sem parar at\xE9 o c\xE9u~ Derruba o rica\xE7o! Boom!"
      - Lompat tanpa henti ke langit~ Jatuhkan orang kaya! Boom!
      - Tumalon nang walang tigil sa langit~ Ibagsak ang mayaman! Boom!
      - "\u7121\u9650\u30B8\u30E3\u30F3\u30D7\u3067\u7A7A\u3078\uFF01\u304A\u91D1\u6301\u3061\u3092\u30C9\u30AB\u30FC\u30F3\uFF01"
