    - Term: S_answer_Des_level_97
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u5C06\u4E00\u4E2A\u6C14\u7403\u62D6\u7ED9boxy\uFF01"
      - Drag a Balloon to Boxy!
      - "Arraste um bal\xE3o at\xE9 o Boxy!"
      - Seret sebuah balon ke Boxy!
      - I-drag ang isang lobo kay Boxy!
      - "\u98A8\u8239\u3092Boxy\u306B\u30C9\u30E9\u30C3\u30B0\uFF01"
      - "\u5C07\u4E00\u500B\u6C23\u7403\u62D6\u7D66 Boxy\uFF01"
      - "\uD48D\uC120\uC744 Boxy\uC5D0\uAC8C \uB04C\uC5B4\uB2E4 \uC918!"
      - "\u041F\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0442\u0430\u0449\u0438 \u0448\u0430\u0440\u0438\u043A
        \u043A Boxy!"
      - "\xA1Arrastra un globo hasta Boxy!"
      - "\xA1Arrastra un globo hasta Boxy!"
      - "Bir balonu Boxy'ye s\xFCr\xFCkle!"
