    - Term: S_congraktTips_Des_level_07
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u6709\u65F6\u5019\u4F60\u771F\u7684\u9700\u8981\u4E00\u4E9B\u86EE\u529B\u6765\u89E3\u51B3\u95EE\u9898\uFF01"
      - Sometimes you really need some brute force to solve a problem !
      - "For\xE7a bruta! Bim! Bum!"
      - Kekuatan kasar! Bim! Bum!
      - Brute force! Boom! Bam!
      - "\u529B\u4ED5\u4E8B\u3067\u89E3\u6C7A\uFF01\u30C9\u30AB\u30FC\u30F3\uFF01"
