    - Term: S_congraktTips_Des_level_62
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u6211\u53EF\u4EE5\u5168\u90E8\u90FD\u9009\u62E9\uFF01"
      - I can choose them all!
      - Eu posso escolher todos!
      - Aku bisa memilih semuanya!
      - Pwede ko silang lahat piliin!
