    - Term: S_congraktTips_Des_level_69
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u8EB2\u907F\u6280\u80FDmax\uFF1F"
      - Dodge skill maxed out?
      - "Esquiva no m\xE1ximo?"
      - Skill menghindar sudah max?
      - Max na ang dodge skill?
      - "\u56DE\u907F\u30B9\u30AD\u30EBMAX\uFF1F"
      - "\u9583\u907F\u6280\u80FDMAX\uFF1F"
      - "\uD68C\uD53C \uC2A4\uD0AC MAX?"
      - "\u041D\u0430\u0432\u044B\u043A \u0443\u043A\u043B\u043E\u043D\u0435\u043D\u0438\u044F
        \u043D\u0430 \u043C\u0430\u043A\u0441\u0438\u043C\u0443\u043C\u0435?"
      - "\xBFHabilidad de esquiva al m\xE1ximo?"
      - "\xBFHabilidad de esquivar al m\xE1ximo?"
      - "Ka\xE7\u0131nma becerisi maksimumda m\u0131?"
