      TermType: 0
      Description: "\u6E05\u7406\u672A\u4F7F\u7528\u7684\u7F13\u5B58\u6587\u4EF6\uFF01"
      Languages:
      - "\u6B63\u5728\u65E0\u804A\u7684\u5DE6\u987E\u53F3\u76FC..."
      - Looking around bored...
      - Olhando ao redor entediado...
      - Melihat sekeliling dengan bosan...
