    - Term: S_LevelHints_Des_level_11
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u4E5F\u8BB8\u4F60\u6233\u7834\u6C14\u7403\u5C31\u53EF\u4EE5\u8BA9\u95E8\u6389\u4E0B\u6765\u3002"
      - Maybe popping the balloon will make the door fall down.
      - "Talvez estourar o bal\xE3o fa\xE7a a porta cair."
      - Mungkin meletuskan balon bisa membuat pintu jatuh.
      - Baka ang pagbutas ng lobo ay magpabagsak ng pinto.
      - "\u98A8\u8239\u3092\u5272\u308C\u3070\u3001\u30C9\u30A2\u304C\u843D\u3061\u3066\u304F\u308B\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\u3002"
