    - Term: S_congraktTips_Des_level_128
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u518D\u73A950\u5173\u6211\u5C31\u7761\u89C9\uFF01"
      - I'll play 50 more levels, then go to sleep!
      - Vou jogar mais 50 fases e depois dormir!
      - Aku akan bermain 50 level lagi, lalu tidur!
      - Maglalaro pa ako ng 50 level bago matulog!
      - "\u3042\u306850\u30B9\u30C6\u30FC\u30B8\u904A\u3093\u3060\u3089\u5BDD\u308B\uFF01"
      - "\u518D\u73A950\u95DC\u6211\u5C31\u7761\u89BA\uFF01"
      - "50\uC2A4\uD14C\uC774\uC9C0\uB9CC \uB354 \uD558\uACE0 \uC798 \uAC70\uC57C!"
      - "\u0415\u0449\u0451 50 \u0443\u0440\u043E\u0432\u043D\u0435\u0439 \u2014
        \u0438 \u0441\u043F\u0430\u0442\u044C!"
      - "\xA1Jugar\xE9 50 niveles m\xE1s y me ir\xE9 a dormir!"
      - "\xA1Jugar\xE9 50 niveles m\xE1s y luego me voy a dormir!"
      - "50 b\xF6l\xFCm daha oynay\u0131p sonra yataca\u011F\u0131m!"
