      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u706B\u7BAD\u51FA\u51FB\uFF01"
      - Rocket launch!
      - "Lan\xE7ar foguete!"
      - Roket meluncur!
      - Rocket, ilunsad!
