    - Term: S_congraktTips_Des_level_140
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u5403\u9971\u4E86\uFF0C\u55DD~"
      - I'm stuffed. Burp~
      - Estou de barriga cheia. Burp~
      - Kenyang sekali. Sendawa~
      - Busog na ako. Burp~
      - "\u304A\u8179\u3044\u3063\u3071\u3044\u3002\u3052\u3077\u3063\u301C"
      - "\u5403\u98FD\u4E86\uFF0C\u55DD\uFF5E"
      - "\uBC30\uBD88\uB7EC. \uAEBC\uC5B5~"
      - "\u041D\u0430\u0435\u043B\u0441\u044F. \u0411\u0443\u0440\u043F~"
      - "Estoy lleno. \xA1Burp!"
      - "Estoy lleno. \xA1Burp!"
      - "T\u0131ka basa doydum. Ge\u011Firdim~"
